ther ul li</p></li></ul></li><li><p>Now go to another section</p><ol><li><p>hi this is me wouuld you like to give a surpise</p></li><li><p>just go and write code peacefully</p></li><li><p>you will be surpised</p></li><li><p>that all about you</p><ol><li><p>Hi this is third listing</p></li><li><p>inside the third listing we are adding <strong>bold</strong> now go ahead</p></li></ol></li></ol></li></ol><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><table class=\\"border-collapse border border-gray-300\\" style=\\"min-width: 75px;\\"><colgroup><col style=\\"min-width: 25px;\\"><col style=\\"min-width: 25px;\\"><col style=\\"min-width: 25px;\\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>test</p></th><th colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>ssa</p></th><th colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>sasa</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>asa</p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>sas</p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>as</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>sa</p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>as</p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>as</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p>", "json": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 1, "textAlign": "center"}, "content": [{"text": "Hi This Side Mihir ( Inside the H1 tag )", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "rgb(255, 0, 0)", "fontFamily": ""}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "center"}}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "center"}}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "center"}, "content": [{"text": "adsasdsaads asdjghads jkhads", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "rgb(255, 0, 0)", "fontFamily": "Verdana"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "center"}, "content": [{"text": "dsadsadsa", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "rgb(255, 0, 0)", "fontFami