cmi335f5r0003gpqkwoqozlk2	cmhj2oqiw0005gpqsgjfwxvww	{"sections": [{"id": "section-1", "type": "text", "order": 0, "title": "Executive Summary", "content": {"html": "<p>Century Plyboards (India) Ltd. (CPIL) aims to position its New Age Products (PVC, WPC, and Zykron fiber cement boards) as future-ready, sustainable alternatives to traditional wood-based materials. This proposal outlines a strategic social media plan to drive awareness, engagement, and consideration among both B2B and B2C audiences through consistent, compelling, and insight-led digital communication.</p>", "json": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Century Plyboards (India) Ltd. (CPIL) aims to position its New Age Products (PVC, WPC, and Zykron fiber cement boards) as future-ready, sustainable alternatives to traditional wood-based materials. This proposal outlines a strategic social media plan to drive awareness, engagement, and consideration among both B2B and B2C audiences through consistent, compelling, and insight-led digital communication.", "type": "text"}]}]}}}, {"id": "section-2", "type": "text", "order": 1, "title": "Project Overview", "content": {"html": "<ul><li><p>Build a modern, mobile-first <strong>Warranty Registration Portal</strong> and a supporting backend dashboard for Century Ply.</p></li><li><p>The system will allow customers to register invoice-based warranties (OTP-verified), upload invoice images/PDFs, and track request status.</p></li><li><p>Internal users (validators, managers, and admins) will validate invoices, approve/reject requests, and issue version-controlled warranty certificates.</p></li></ul><h1>Goals</h1><ul><li><p>Reduce errors and delays from phone/email-based warranty registrations.</p></li><li><p>Prevent fake/incorrect warranty issuance through manual invoice validation.</p></li><li><p>Provide role-based access for customers, dealers, validators, and admins.</p></li></ul><p></p>", "json": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Build a modern, mobile-first ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "Warranty Registration Portal", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"text": " and a supporting backend dashboard for Century Ply.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "The system will allow customers to register invoice-based warranties (OTP-verified), upload invoice images/PDFs, and track request status.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Internal users (validators, managers, and admins) will validate invoices, approve/reject requests, and issue version-controlled warranty certificates.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 1, "textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Goals", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Reduce errors and delays from phone/email-based warranty registrations.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Prevent fake/incorrect warranty issuance through manual invoice validation.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Provide role-based access for customers, dealers, validators, and admins.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}}]}}}, {"id": "section-3", "type": "text", "order": 2, "title": "Scope of Work (Deliverables)", "content": {"html": "<p></p><h1>1. Landing Page</h1><p><strong>Objective:</strong> To introduce users to the Century Promise Warranty System and guide them seamlessly toward warranty registration or product verification.</p><h4>Key Features:</h4><ul><li><p><strong>Hero Banner Section</strong></p><ul><li><p>Tagline: \\"Your Ply, Your Proof, Your Peace of Mind – Forever.\\"</p></li><li><p>Prominent brand imagery and Century Promise logo for trust and recall.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Primary Call-to-Action (CTA) Buttons</strong></p><ul><li><p>Register Warranty</p></li><li><p>Check Product Genuineness</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Quick Access Links</strong></p><ul><li><p>Warranty Policy</p></li><li><p>FAQs</p></li><li><p>Contact Support</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Responsive Design</strong> - Optimized for both desktop and mobile interfaces</p></li><li><p><strong>Dealer &amp; Contact Accessibility</strong></p><ul><li><p>Integrated dealer locator</p></li><li><p>Quick contact or inquiry form</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Trust Indicators</strong></p><ul><li><p>Century Promise logo and authenticity seals</p></li><li><p>Verified brand assets and badges for credibility</p></li></ul></li></ul><h3>2. Web Portal — Warranty Registration</h3><p><strong>Objective:</strong> To enable customers to register their product warranties easily using invoice details and personal information.</p><h4>Core Functionalities:</h4><ul><li><p><strong>User Access</strong> - Customer login/registration via OTP (email/SMS) authentication</p></li><li><p><strong>Warranty Registration Form</strong></p><ul><li><p>Invoice upload support (Image / PDF)</p></li><li><p>Auto-fill dealer details (from dealer database or manual entry by customer)</p></li><li><p>Product and purchase details capture</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>System Actions</strong></p><ul><li><p>Auto-generation of Warranty Registration Number (WRN)</p></li><li><p>Real-time confirmation message: \\"Your warranty registration has been submitted successfully. You'll receive your certificate after verification.\\"</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Customer Access to Records</strong></p><ul><li><p>View previously registered warranties</p></li><li><p>Search warranties by invoice number, phone, or email</p></li></ul></li></ul><h3>3. User Dashboard (Customer Portal)</h3><p><strong>Objective:</strong> To provide registered customers with a self-service area for managing warranties, profiles, and documents.</p><h4>Features:</h4><ul><li><p><strong>Secure Login</strong> - Access via Mobile OTP or Email verification</p></li><li><p><strong>Dashboard Sections</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>My Warranties:</strong> List of registered products with real-time status (Pending, Approved, Rejected)</p></li><li><p><strong>Profile Settings:</strong> Update personal details, address, and contact information</p></li><li><p><strong>Digital Certificates:</strong> View or download warranty certificates (PDF format)</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Automated Notifications:</strong> Email confirmation upon successful certificate generation</p></li></ul><h3>4. Backend Dashboard (Internal Use)</h3><p><strong>Objective:</strong> To provide the internal Century team with tools for validation, management, reporting, and policy control.</p><h4>Modules &amp; Features:</h4><ul><li><p><strong>Dashboard Overview</strong></p><ul><li><p>Total warranties registered</p></li><li><p>Pending validations</p></li><li><p>Approved / Rejected warranties</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Warranty Validation Module</strong></p><ul><li><p>View detailed registration and invoice data</p></li><li><p>Manual invoice verification process</p></li><li><p>Approve or reject warranty requests with comments</p></li><li><p>Automated email/SMS notifications to customers</p></li><li><p>Generate and issue digital warranty certificates</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Version Control &amp; Policy Management</strong></p><ul><li><p>Upload and manage warranty policy documents</p></li><li><p>Assign and track version numbers</p></li><li><p>Auto-link latest policy version to all new registrations</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>User &amp; Dealer Management</strong></p><ul><li><p>Manage customer and dealer records</p></li><li><p>Edit / update dealer code mappings</p></li><li><p>Role-based access control and audit logs</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Reports &amp; Data Export</strong></p><ul><li><p>Generate monthly warranty reports (CSV / Excel format)</p></li><li><p>Filter by date, dealer, product group, or city</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Certificate Generation Engine</strong> - Auto-generate PDF warranty certificates with:</p><ul><li><p>Unique Warranty ID</p></li><li><p>Version number</p></li><li><p>Issue and expiry dates (as per policy rules)</p></li><li><p>Product and invoice details</p></li></ul></li></ul><p></p>", "json": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 1, "textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "1. Landing Page", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Objective:", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"text": " To introduce users to the Century Promise Warranty System and guide them seamlessly toward warranty registration or product verification.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 4, "textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Key Features:", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Hero Banner Section", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Tagline: \\"Your Ply, Your Proof, Your Peace of Mind – Forever.\\"", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Prominent brand imagery and Century Promise logo for trust and recall.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Primary Call-to-Action (CTA) Buttons", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Register Warranty", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Check Product Genuineness", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Quick Access Links", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Warranty Policy", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "FAQs", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Contact Support", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Responsive Design", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"text": " - Optimized for both desktop and mobile interfaces", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Dealer & Contact Accessibility", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Integrated dealer locator", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Quick contact or inquiry form", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "