prehensive testing at each stage", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Documentation:", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"text": " Complete technical and user documentation", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Training:", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"text": " End-user and admin training sessions", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}}]}}}, {"id": "section-6", "type": "pricing", "order": 5, "title": "Investment & Pricing", "content": {"html": "<p></p><p>Comprehensive pricing for the Century Ply Warranty Portal development project.</p><table class=\\"border-collapse border border-gray-300\\" style=\\"min-width: 75px;\\"><colgroup><col style=\\"min-width: 25px;\\"><col style=\\"min-width: 25px;\\"><col style=\\"min-width: 25px;\\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>Deliverable</p></th><th colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>Description</p></th><th colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>Cost</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p><strong>Landing Page</strong></p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>Responsive landing page with CTAs, trust indicators, and dealer locator</p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>₹75,000</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p><strong>Customer Portal</strong></p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>Warranty registration, OTP authentication, document upload, dashboard</p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>₹2,50,000</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p><strong>Backend Dashboard</strong></p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>Validation module, user management, reporting, certificate generation</p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>₹3,50,000</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"1\\