on Control & Policy Management", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Upload and manage warranty policy documents", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Assign and track version numbers", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Auto-link latest policy version to all new registrations", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "User & Dealer Management", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Manage customer and dealer records", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Edit / update dealer code mappings", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Role-based access control and audit logs", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Reports & Data Export", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Generate monthly warranty reports (CSV / Excel format)", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Filter by date, dealer, product group, or city", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Certificate Generation Engine", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"text": " - Auto-generate PDF warranty certificates with:", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Unique Warranty ID", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Version number", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Issue and expiry dates (as per policy rules)", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Product and invoice details", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}}]}}}, {"id": "section-4", "type": "text", "order": 3, "title": "Customer Journey", "content": {"html": "<p><strong>Step-by-Step Flow:</strong></p><ol><li><p><strong>Purchase Stage</strong></p><ul><li><p>Customer buys plywood from an authorized dealer and receives a valid invoice.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Registration Stage</strong></p><ul><li><p>Customer visits the Century Promise Warranty Portal and selects \\"Register Warranty.\\"</p></li><li><p>Invoice details are entered and uploaded for verification.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Validation Stage</strong></p><ul><li><p>Data is transmitted to the backend validation team.</p></li><li><p>Manual verification of invoice and dealer details is conducted.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Certificate Generation</strong></p><ul><li><p>Upon approval, a unique Warranty Identification Number (WIN) is generated.</p></li><li><p>A digital warranty certificate is issued and emailed to the customer.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Post-Registration Access</strong></p><ul><li><p>Customers can log in anytime to view, download, or verify their registered warranties.</p></li></ul></li></ol><p></p>", "json": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Step-by-Step Flow:", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"type": null, "start": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Purchase Stage", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Customer buys plywood from an authorized dealer and receives a valid invoice.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Registration Stage", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Customer visits the Century Promise Warranty Portal and selects \\"Register Warranty.\\"", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Invoice details are entered and uploaded for verification.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Validation Stage", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Data is transmitted to the backend validation team.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Manual verification of invoice and dealer details is conducted.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Certificate Generation", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Upon approval, a unique Warranty Identification Number (WIN) is generated.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "A digital warranty certificate is issued and emailed to the customer.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Post-Registration Access", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Customers can log in anytime to view, download, or verify their registered warranties.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}}]}}}, {"id": "section-5", "type": "text", "order": 4, "title": "Project Management", "content": {"html": "<p></p><p>Our development process has a systematic approach in managing a project.</p><h3>Execution Model</h3><p>The Interactive Bees dedicated team will start the project after signing the contract. A delivery schedule will be provided keeping in mind the project priority. We follow basic project management techniques that include 3 key activities:</p><table class=\\"border-collapse border border-gray-300\\" style=\\"min-width: 50px;\\"><colgroup><col style=\\"min-width: 25px;\\"><col style=\\"min-width: 25px;\\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p><strong>Project Initiation</strong></p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>The project plan will be put on a timeline, with the milestones and deliverables clearly identified.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p><strong>Project Planning</strong></p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>The project plan will be created as per the tasks. The critical path for the project will be identified, and appropriate resources will be allocated.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p><strong>Project Execution</strong></p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>Regular status updates and milestone reviews will be conducted to ensure the project stays on track.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Development Methodology</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Agile Approach:</strong> Iterative development with regular client feedback</p></li><li><p><strong>Quality Assurance:</strong> Comprehensive testing at each stage</p></li><li><p><strong>Documentation:</strong> Complete technical and user documentation</p></li><li><p><strong>Training:</strong> End-user and admin training sessions</p></li></ul><p></p>", "json": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Our development process has a systematic approach in managing a project.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Execution Model", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "The Interactive Bees dedicated team will start the project after signing the contract. A delivery schedule will be provided keeping in mind the project priority. We follow basic project management techniques that include 3 key activities:", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "table", "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "colwidth": null}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Project Initiation", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "colwid