on Control & Policy Management", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Upload and manage warranty policy documents", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Assign and track version numbers", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Auto-link latest policy version to all new registrations", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "User & Dealer Management", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Manage customer and dealer records", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Edit / update dealer code mappings", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Role-based access control and audit logs", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Reports & Data Export", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Generate monthly warranty reports (CSV / Excel format)", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Filter by date, dealer, product group, or city", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Certificate Generation Engine", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"text": " - Auto-generate PDF warranty certificates with:", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Unique Warranty ID", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Version number", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Issue and expiry dates (as per policy rules)", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Product and invoice details", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}}]}}}, {"id": "section-4", "type": "text", "order": 3, "title": "Customer Journey", "content": {"html": "<p><strong>Step-by-Step Flow:</strong></p><ol><li><p><strong>Purchase Stage</strong></p><ul><li><p>Customer buys plywood from an authorized dealer and receives a valid invoice.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Registration Stage</strong></p><ul><li><p>Customer visits the Century Promise Warranty Portal and selects \\"Register Warranty.\\"</p></li><li><p>Invoice details are entered and uploaded for verification.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Validation Stage</strong></p><ul><li><p>Data is transmitted to the backend validation team.</p></li><li><p>Manual verification of invoice and dealer details is conducted.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Certificate Generation</strong></p><ul><li><p>Upon approval, a unique Warranty Identification Number (WIN) is generated.</p></li><li><p>A digital warranty certificate is issued and emailed to the customer.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Post-Registration Access</strong></p><ul><li><p>Customers can log in anytime to view, download, or verify their registered warranties.</p></li></ul></li></ol><p></p>", "json": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Step-by-Step Flow:", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"type": null, "start": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Purchase Stage", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Customer buys plywood from an authorized dealer and receives a valid invoice.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Registration Stage", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Customer visits the Century Promise Warranty Portal and selects \\"Register Warranty.\\"", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Invoice details are entered and uploaded for verification.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Validation Stage", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Data is transmitted to the backend validation team.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Manual verification of invoice and dealer details is conducted.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "co