owspan=\\"1\\"><p><strong>Project Planning</strong></p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>The project plan will be created as per the tasks. The critical path for the project will be identified, and appropriate resources will be allocated.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p><strong>Project Execution</strong></p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p>Regular status updates and milestone reviews will be conducted to ensure the project stays on track.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Development Methodology</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Agile Approach:</strong> Iterative development with regular client feedback</p></li><li><p><strong>Quality Assurance:</strong> Comprehensive testing at each stage</p></li><li><p><strong>Documentation:</strong> Complete technical and user documentation</p></li><li><p><strong>Training:</strong> End-user and admin training sessions</p></li></ul><p></p>", "json": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Our development process has a systematic approach in managing a project.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Execution Model", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "The Interactive Bees dedicated team will start the project after signing the contract. A delivery schedule will be provided keeping in mind the project priority. We follow basic project management techniques that include 3 key activities:", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "table", "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "colwidth": null}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Project Initiation", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "colwid