e to view, download, or verify their registered warranties.</p></li></ul></li></ol><p></p>", "json": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Step-by-Step Flow:", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"type": null, "start": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Purchase Stage", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Customer buys plywood from an authorized dealer and receives a valid invoice.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Registration Stage", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Customer visits the Century Promise Warranty Portal and selects \\"Register Warranty.\\"", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Invoice details are entered and uploaded for verification.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Validation Stage", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Data is transmitted to the backend validation team.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Manual verification of invoice and dealer details is conducted.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "co