}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": "·", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Symbol"}}]}, {"text": "        ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "7pt", "fontFamily": "\\"Times New Roman\\""}}]}, {"text": "Proper products/offerings information and other related information", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": "·", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Symbol"}}]}, {"text": "        ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "7pt", "fontFamily": "\\"Times New Roman\\""}}]}, {"text": "Easy to Navigate", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": "·", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Symbol"}}]}, {"text": "        ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "7pt", "fontFamily": "\\"Times New Roman\\""}}]}, {"text": "Cleaner layout for effective content dissemination", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": "·", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Symbol"}}]}, {"text": "        ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "7pt", "fontFamily": "\\"Times New Roman\\""}}]}, {"text": "Optimized speed and quick loading times", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}}}, {"id": "section-1787125952822", "type": "text", "order": 5, "title": "Website & CMS Functionalities", "content": {"html": "<ul><li><p><strong>Site &amp; Content Management</strong></p><ul><li><p>WYSIWYG editor to create, edit and format website content without requiring technical expertise.</p></li><li><p>Manage content across dynamic pages such as About, Sustainability, CSR, Careers and Contact Us.</p></li><li><p>Ability to add, edit, publish, unpublish and delete content through the CMS.</p></li><li><p>Content hierarchy and navigation management for organising website pages and sections.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Product Management</strong></p><ul><li><p>Dedicated product management module for managing the MDF product portfolio.</p></li><li><p>Ability to add, edit, update, publish/unpublish and delete products.</p></li><li><p>Manage product categories including Standard MDF, BOIL X, FR MDF, HDMR MDF and Prelam MDF.</p></li><li><p>Manage product descriptions, specifications, images and other relevant product information.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Banner Management</strong></p><ul><li><p>Dedicated module to manage homepage and applicable inner-page banners.</p></li><li><p>Admins can add, edit, replace, activate, deactivate and delete banners.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>SEO Management</strong></p><ul><li><p>Backend functionality to manage essential on-page SEO parameters for major website pages.</p></li><li><p>Ability to update page title, meta description and relevant SEO fields.</p></li><li><p>Customisable URL/slugs for applicable dynamic pages.</p></li><li><p>SEO-friendly content structure to support future organic search optimisation.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Forms &amp; Enquiry Management</strong></p><ul><li><p>Implementation of enquiry/contact forms as defined in the approved Figma designs.</p></li><li><p>Form submissions to be routed to designated email IDs.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Social Media Linking</strong></p><ul><li><p>Integration of social media links across relevant sections of the website.</p></li><li><p>Ability to manage/update social media profile links through the CMS.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Google Analytics Integration</strong></p><ul><li><p>Integration of Google Analytics to track website traffic, user behaviour and key engagement metrics.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Admin &amp; User Management</strong></p><ul><li><p>Secure backend login for authorised CMS users.</p></li><li><p>Ability to create and manage admin users, subject to the CMS architecture.</p></li><li><p>Role-based access can be configured for different levels of content management, wherever required.</p></li><li><p>Secure authentication and access controls for the CMS.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p></p>", "json": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Site & Content Management", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "WYSIWYG editor to create, edit and format website content without requiring technical expertise.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Manage content across dynamic pages such as About, Sustainability, CSR, Careers and Contact Us.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Ability to add, edit, publish, unpublish and delete content through the CMS.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "lis