;\\">Technologies: HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, jQuery</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Interactive and lightweight interface with modern animations and transitions</span></p></li></ul><p><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\"><strong>2. Back-End Development</strong></span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Frameworks: Next.js and Node.js</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\"> </span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Fast, scalable, and SEO-friendly performance with server-side rendering support</span></p></li></ul><p><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\"><strong>3. Database</strong></span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">PostgreSQL</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Reliable and efficient relational database system for structured data management</span></p></li></ul><p></p>", "json": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "1. Front-End Development", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "18px", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}, {"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Technologies: HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, jQuery", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "18px", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Interactive and lightweight interface with modern animations and transitions", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "18px", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "2. Back-End Development", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "18px", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}, {"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Frameworks: Next.js and Node.js", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "18px", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": " ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "18px", "fontFamily": "\\"Times New Roman\\""}}]}, {"text": "Fast, scalable, and SEO-friendly performance with server-side rendering support", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "18px", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "3. Database", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "18px", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}, {"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "PostgreSQL", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "18px", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Reliable and efficient relational database system for structured data management", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "18px", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}}]}}}, {"id": "section-1787126350073", "type": "text", "order": 7, "title": "Project Management  ", "content": {"html": "<p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Our development process has a systematic approach in managing a project.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\"><strong>Execution Model<em>&nbsp;</em></strong>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Interactive Bees dedicated team will start the project after signing the contract. A delivery schedule will be provided keeping in mind the project priority. We follow basic project management techniques that include the 3 key activities:&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><table class=\\"border-collapse border border-gray-300\\" style=\\"min-width: 50px;\\"><colgroup><col style=\\"min-width: 25px;\\"><col style=\\"min-width: 25px;\\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Project Initiation&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">·</span><span style=\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">The project plan will be put on a timeline, with the milestones and deliverables clearly identified.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Project Planning&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">·</span><span style=\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">The project plan will be created as per the tasks. The critical path for the project will be identified and appropriate resources will be allocated, to ensure the success of the project.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">·</span><span style=\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Also, a risk management plan will be put into place to handle any contingencies that may arise. Standby resources and contingency mechanisms will be put into place.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Project Monitoring&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">·</span><span style=\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">The project manager will continually update the project plan, monitor the project and communicate progress.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Symbol;\\">·</span><span style=\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">At any point in the project, if a delay is forecast in the completion of an activity, the project manager will take steps to keep the client apprised of the steps taken to facilitate timely project completion.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\"><strong>Team<em>&nbsp;</em></strong>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">The Project Manager will head the Development Team at Interactive Bees and is stationed at the Delhi Office of Interactive Bees. The project manager would be responsible for ensuring timely project execution and delivery.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\"><strong>Communication Channels<em>&nbsp;</em></strong>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Interactive Bees Project Manager will provide updates on project status to the client’s team on request or on a pre-defined basis. These project updates will include:&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Project Schedules, updated if applicable&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Project Status&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\"> </span><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Communication issues&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p></p>", "json": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Our development process has a systematic approach in managing a project.  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}, {"type": "hardBreak", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}, {"text": " ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Execution Model", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}, {"type": "bold"}]}, {"text": " ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}, {"type": "bold"}, {"type": "italic"}]}, {"text": " ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Interactive Bees dedicated team will start the project after signing the contract. A delivery schedule will be provided keeping in mind the project priority. We follow basic project management techniques that include the 3 key activities:  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}, {"type": "table", "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "colwidth": null}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Project Initiation  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "colwidth": null}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "·", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Symbol"}}]}, {"text": "        ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "7pt", "fontFamily": "\\"Times New Roman\\""}}]}, {"text": "The project plan will be put on a timeline, with the milestones and deliverables clearly identified.  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "colwidth": null}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Project Planning  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "colwidth": null}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "·", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Symbol"}}]}, {"text": "        ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "7pt", "fontFamily": "\\"Times New Roman\\""}}]}, {"text": "The project plan will be created as per the tasks. The critical path for the project will be identified and appropriate resources will be allocated, to ensure the success of the project.  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "·", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Symbol"}}]}, {"text": "        ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "7pt", "fontFamily": "\\"Times New Roman\\""}}]}, {"text": "Also, a risk management plan will be put into place to handle any contingencies that may arise. Standby resources and contingency mechanisms will be put into place.  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "colwidth": null}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Project Monitoring  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "colwidth": null}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "·", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Symbol"}}]}, {"text": "        ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "7pt", "fontFamily": "\\"Times New Roman\\""}}]}, {"text": "The project manager will continually update the project plan, monitor the project and communicate progress.  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "·", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Symbol"}}]}, {"text": "        ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "7pt", "fontFamily": "\\"Times New Roman\\""}}]}, {"text": "At any point in the project, if a delay is forecast in the completion of an activity, the project manager will take steps to keep the client apprised of the steps taken to facilitate timely project completion.  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Team", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}, {"type": "bold"}]}, {"text": " ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}, {"type": "bold"}, {"type": "italic"}]}, {"text": " ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "The Project Manager will head the Development Team at Interactive Bees and is stationed at the Delhi Office of Interactive Bees. The project manager would be responsible for ensuring timely project execution and delivery.  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}, {"type": "hardBreak", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}, {"text": " ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Communication Channels", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}, {"type": "bold"}]}, {"text": " ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}, {"type": "bold"}, {"type": "italic"}]}, {"text": " ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Interactive Bees Project Manager will provide updates on project status to the client’s team on request or on a pre-defined basis. These project updates will include:  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Project Schedules, updated if applicable   ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Project Status  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": " ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "7pt", "fontFamily": "\\"Times New Roman\\""}}]}, {"text": "Communication issues  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}}]}}}, {"id": "section-1787126412845", "type": "text", "order": 8, "title": "Delivery Mechanism", "content": {"html": "<ul><li><p>Throughout the tenure the site would be developed on our staging server, for which Interactive Bees would be sharing the URLs so that clients can view the site on the server environment.   </p></li><li><p>Final website upon confirmation would be hosted on server once the commercials have been settled.  </p></li><li><p>Reviews, responses, and clarifications will be handled through scheduled meetings/ e-meetings, e-mail, conference calls, and faxes.</p></li><li><p>In lower navigation we write Designed and Developed by Interactive Bees as a policy.  </p></li></ul><p></p><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\"><strong>Change Management<em>&nbsp;</em></strong>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Any change in requirements after approval of a deliverable or delay in feedback may lead to additional work and will have to be agreed upon mutually by Interactive Bees and the client.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>", "json": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Throughout the tenure the site would be developed on our staging server, for which Interactive Bees would be sharing the URLs so that clients can view the site on the server environment.   ", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Final website upon confirmation would be hosted on server once the commercials have been settled.  ", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Reviews, responses, and clarifications will be handled through scheduled meetings/ e-meetings, e-mail, conference calls, and faxes.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "In lower navigation we write Designed and Developed by Interactive Bees as a policy.  ", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Change Management", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}, {"type": "bold"}]}, {"text": " ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}, {"type": "bold"}, {"type": "italic"}]}, {"text": " ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Any change in requirements after approval of a deliverable or delay in feedback may lead to additional work and will have to be agreed upon mutually by Interactive Bees and the client.  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}}}, {"id": "section-1787126477964", "type": "text", "order": 9, "title": "Our Process", "content": {"html": "<ul><li><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Brief from the Customer about the services offered and the industries served.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Brand brief; guidelines, color preferences, image preferences&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Wireframes to be shared and finalized&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Designs to be shared and finalized&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Templatization&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Backend programming&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Content feeding&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Optimization: responsiveness, speed, loading&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Security&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\"> </span><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Ready to go Live&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p></p>", "json": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": "Brief from the Customer about the services offered and the industries served.  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": "Brand brief; guidelines, color preferences, image preferences  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": "Wireframes to be shared and finalized  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": "Designs to be shared and finalized  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": "Templatization  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": "Backend programming  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": "Content feeding  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": "Optimization: responsiveness, speed, loading  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": "Security  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": " ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "7pt", "fontFamily": "\\"Times New Roman\\""}}]}, {"text": "Ready to go Live   ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}}]}}}, {"id": "section-1787126510100", "type": "text", "order": 10, "title": "Project Costs  ", "content": {"html": "<table class=\\"border-collapse border border-gray-300\\" style=\\"width: 763px;\\"><colgroup><col style=\\"width: 595px;\\"><col style=\\"width: 168px;\\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\" colwidth=\\"595\\"><p>Services</p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\" colwidth=\\"168\\"><p>Cost (INR)</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\" colwidth=\\"595\\"><p>Deployment of Virgo MDF Website  from Existing Figma</p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\" colwidth=\\"168\\"><p>1.50 lakhs</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\"><strong><em>Rupees: Five Lakhs and Fifty thousand only.</em></strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\"><strong><em>Please note:</em></strong>&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Hosting and server infrastructure charges shall be additional.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Applicable GST shall be charged extra.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Content, product information, images, and company assets shall be provided by the client.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\"> </span><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Any third-party plugins, stock assets, APIs, or licensed tools shall be charged additionally.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\"> </span><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Any scope beyond the agreed deliverables shall be treated as change requests and charged separately.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Timely approvals and feedback are critical to meet delivery timelines, especially for the pre-event launch phase.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">3 months of post-launch technical support for bug fixes, CMS queries, and minor updates included.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\"> </span><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Content writing is strictly limited to the sitemap and page structure mentioned in this proposal. The baseline/reference content shall be referred from the existing </span><a target=\\"_new\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\" href=\\"https://virgolam.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Virgo Laminates Website</span></a><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\"> and will be suitably adapted, refined, and aligned to the MDF business  requirements.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Complete website transfer will be provided upon receipt of the final payment, including the source code, CMS/Admin access, database, and all related project credentials and assets.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">All website designs, UI/UX elements, development code, and creative assets developed as part of this project shall become the sole property of VIRGO MDF upon successful completion of the project and receipt of full payment.</span></p></li></ul><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\"><strong>Assumptions:</strong>&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Content for various sections (facts and figures) would be provided to us by the client.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Pictures and videos would be given to us by the client; we would convert them to the web format.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">Timely reverts on the work submission would be required, in order to meet the deadlines.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p></p>", "json": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "table", "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "colwidth": [595]}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Services", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "colwidth": [168]}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Cost (INR)", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "colwidth": [595]}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Deployment of Virgo MDF Website  from Existing Figma", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "colwidth": [168]}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "1.50 lakhs", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Rupees: Five Lakhs and Fifty thousand only.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}, {"type": "bold"}, {"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": " ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": "Please note:", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}, {"type": "bold"}, {"type": "italic"}]}, {"text": " ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Hosting and server infrastructure charges shall be additional.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Applicable GST shall be charged extra.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Content, product information, images, and company assets shall be provided by the client.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": " ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "7pt", "fontFamily": "\\"Times New Roman\\""}}]}, {"text": "Any third-party plugins, stock assets, APIs, or licensed tools shall be charged additionally.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": " ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "7pt", "fontFamily": "\\"Times New Roman\\""}}]}, {"text": "Any scope beyond the agreed deliverables shall be treated as change requests and charged separately.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Timely approvals and feedback are critical to meet delivery timelines, especially for the pre-event launch phase.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "3 months of post-launch technical support for bug fixes, CMS queries, and minor updates included.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": " ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "7pt", "fontFamily": "\\"Times New Roman\\""}}]}, {"text": "Content writing is strictly limited to the sitemap and page structure mentioned in this proposal. The baseline/reference content shall be referred from the existing ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}, {"text": "Virgo Laminates Website", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"rel": "noopener noreferrer nofollow", "href": "https://virgolam.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com", "class": null, "target": "_new"}}, {"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}, {"text": " and will be suitably adapted, refined, and aligned to the MDF business  requirements.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Complete website transfer will be provided upon receipt of the final payment, including the source code, CMS/Admin access, database, and all related project credentials and assets.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "All website designs, UI/UX elements, development code, and creative assets developed as part of this project shall become the sole property of VIRGO MDF upon successful completion of the project and receipt of full payment.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Assumptions:", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}, {"type": "bold"}]}, {"text": " ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Content for various sections (facts and figures) would be provided to us by the client. ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Pictures and videos would be given to us by the client; we would convert them to the web format. ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Timely reverts on the work submission would be required, in order to meet the deadlines.  ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}}]}}}, {"id": "section-1787126810633", "type": "text", "order": 11, "title": "Payment Schedule for Website Designing & Development ", "content": {"html": "<ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">An amount equal to <strong>50% of the assignment's</strong> value shall be paid in advance, along with the signed work order.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\"><strong>25%</strong> on approval of FIGMA Designs for Dynamic Website.</span></p></li><li><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\"><strong>Balance of 25% payment</strong> shall be paid upon completion of the assignment and showing it on our staging servers. Once the complete outstanding has been cleared the website will be transferred.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">A change in scope while work is in progress will result in additional charges, which will be communicated when the request for the change arrives. Minor changes may be incorporated without additional charges.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">Costs quoted are valid for 10 days from the date of this proposal.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">This proposal does not bind either party to either provide or consume services.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p></p>", "json": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "An amount equal to ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}, {"text": "50% of the assignment's", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}, {"type": "bold"}]}, {"text": " value shall be paid in advance, along with the signed work order. ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": "25%", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}, {"type": "bold"}]}, {"text": " on approval of FIGMA Designs for Dynamic Website.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": "Balance of 25% payment", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}, {"type": "bold"}]}, {"text": " shall be paid upon completion of the assignment and showing it on our staging servers. Once the complete outstanding has been cleared the website will be transferred. ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": "A change in scope while work is in progress will result in additional charges, which will be communicated when the request for the change arrives. Minor changes may be incorporated without additional charges. ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": "Costs quoted are valid for 10 days from the date of this proposal. ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": "This proposal does not bind either party to either provide or consume services. ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "11pt", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}}]}}}]}	cmhhx7sjt0000ukrshnx7v5d0	Proposal updated	2026-08-19 08:10:34.986
cmsztga0v0005k304rizi5501	cmszt6ndb0001k304zmbevjps	{"sections": [{"id": "section-1", "type": "text", "order": 0, "title": "Project Overview", "content": {"html": "<p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Interactive Bees has been entrusted with the development of the digital presence for <strong>Virgo Group’s MDF business</strong>. The project involves converting the already-approved UI/UX designs, created by another agency in Figma, into a fully functional, responsive and performance-optimised website.</span></p><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Our scope will primarily focus on <strong>front-end development and CMS development</strong>, ensuring that the website accurately reflects the approved designs while providing the Virgo team with an easy-to-use content management system. The CMS will enable authorised users to independently manage key website content such as pages, products, product specifications, images, banners and other relevant content without requiring technical intervention.</span></p><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">The objective is to deliver a robust, scalable and user-friendly website that combines the approved visual experience with a flexible backend, making the platform easy to manage and maintain over the long term.</span></p>", "json": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Interactive Bees has been entrusted with the development of the digital presence for ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": null, "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": null}}]}, {"text": "Virgo Group’s MDF business", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": null, "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": null}}, {"type": "bold"}]}, {"text": ". The project involves converting the already-approved UI/UX designs, created by another agency in Figma, into a fully functional, responsive and performance-optimised website.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": null, "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": null}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Our scope will primarily focus on ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": null, "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": null}}]}, {"text": "front-end development and CMS development", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": null, "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": null}}, {"type": "bold"}]}, {"text": ", ensuring that the website accurately reflects the approved designs while providing the Virgo team with an easy-to-use content management system. The CMS will enable authorised users to independently manage key website content such as pages, products, product specifications, images, banners and other relevant content without requiring technical intervention.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": null, "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": null}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "The objective is to deliver a robust, scalable and user-friendly website that combines the approved visual experience with a flexible backend, making the platform easy to manage and maintain over the long term.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": null, "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": null}}]}]}]}}}, {"id": "section-1787125210239", "type": "text", "order": 1, "title": "Scope of Work", "content": {"html": "<ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\"><strong>Front-End Development</strong></span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Convert the approved Figma designs into a fully functional, responsive website.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Develop all website pages and components as per the approved UI/UX.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Ensure pixel-accurate implementation of layouts, typography, colours, imagery, animations and interactive elements.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Optimise the interface for desktop, tablet and mobile devices.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\"><strong>CMS Development</strong></span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Develop a customised, user-friendly CMS for managing website content.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Enable content management for pages, product categories, products, product specifications, images, banners and other applicable website sections.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Provide appropriate content fields and management options based on the approved website structure.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Implement role-based access, wherever required, for authorised users.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\"><strong>Forms &amp; Enquiries</strong></span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Develop enquiry/contact forms as defined in the approved designs.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Configure form submissions to the designated email ID(s).</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Implement appropriate validation and basic spam protection.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\"><strong>Responsive &amp; Cross-Browser Development</strong></span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Ensure compatibility across commonly used modern browsers.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Optimise the website experience across desktop, tablet and mobile screen sizes.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\"><strong>Performance Optimisation</strong></span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Optimise front-end assets, code and page loading for improved website performance.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Follow development best practices to ensure a fast and efficient user experience.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\"><strong>SEO-Ready Development</strong></span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Implement SEO-friendly website architecture and URL structure.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Configure essential technical SEO elements such as page titles, meta descriptions, headings and image alt attributes through the CMS, wherever applicable.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\"><strong>Security &amp; Scalability</strong></span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Follow secure development practices for both the website and CMS.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Build the platform with a scalable architecture to support future enhancements and integrations.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\"><strong>Testing &amp; Quality Assurance</strong></span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Conduct functional, responsive and cross-browser testing across the developed website.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Identify and resolve development-level bugs and inconsistencies before launch.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Conduct a final pre-launch quality check against the approved Figma designs.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\"><strong>Deployment &amp; Launch Support</strong></span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Configure the website for deployment on the client-approved hosting/server environment.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Support the production deployment and go-live process.</span></p></li></ul></li></ul><p></p>", "json": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Front-End Development", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": null, "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": null}}, {"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Convert the approved Figma designs into a fully functional, responsive website.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": null, "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": null}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Develop all website pages and components as per the approved UI/UX.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": null, "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": null}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Ensure pixel-accurate implementation of layouts, typography, colours, imagery, animations and interactive elements.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": null, "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": null}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Optimise the interface for desktop, tablet and mobile devices.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": null, "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": null}}]}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "CMS Development", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": null, "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": null}}, {"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"text": "Develop a customised, user-friendly CMS for managing website content.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "att