, "content": [{"text": "Effective Content Dissemination ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "", "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}}]}}}, {"id": "section-1787125941892", "type": "text", "order": 4, "title": "The website would be developed with the following features:", "content": {"html": "<p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Symbol; color: black;\\">·</span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: black;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">Fast, engaging and more vibrant looking, appealing to today’s sensibilities.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Symbol; color: black;\\">·</span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: black;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">Set the context by creating clear pages on the product’s offering.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Symbol; color: black;\\">·</span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: black;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">Create an experience that entices and engages the target audience</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Symbol; color: black;\\">·</span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: black;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">By using terminologies, that users understand&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Symbol; color: black;\\">·</span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: black;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">Swift and user-friendly navigation.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Symbol; color: black;\\">·</span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: black;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">Create a visual experience with engaging content styling</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Symbol; color: black;\\">·</span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: black;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">Simple contact options (CTA’s) for easy outreach.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Symbol; color: black;\\">·</span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: black;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">Intuitive design with cookie captures functionality.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Symbol; color: black;\\">·</span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: black;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">Consistent with browsers</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Symbol; color: black;\\">·</span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: black;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">Efficient use of technology for faster results and loading of information</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Symbol; color: black;\\">·</span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: black;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">Scalable technology for constant development and upgradation</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Symbol; color: black;\\">·</span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: black;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">Engaging features and rich content to keep users interested.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Symbol; color: black;\\">·</span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: black;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">Responsive design for seamless access and viewing on various devices.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Symbol; color: black;\\">·</span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: black;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">Meaningful input validation to ensure accurate data submission.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">The main focus of the platform would be towards providing an enhanced user experience and easy to navigate website, </span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\">where the</span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\"> user spends more time on reading the content and less time searching for it.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">Hence achieving the same following features would be kept in mind:</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Symbol; color: black;\\">·</span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: black;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">Proper products/offerings information and other related information</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Symbol; color: black;\\">·</span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: black;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">Easy to Navigate</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Symbol; color: black;\\">·</span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: black;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\\">Cleaner layout for effective content dissemination</s