on", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": "·", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": "Symbol"}}]}, {"text": "        ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": "\\"Times New Roman\\""}}]}, {"text": "Easy to Navigate", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": "·", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": "Symbol"}}]}, {"text": "        ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": "\\"Times New Roman\\""}}]}, {"text": "Cleaner layout for effective content dissemination", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": "justify"}, "content": [{"text": "·", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": "Symbol"}}]}, {"text": "        ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": "\\"Times New Roman\\""}}]}, {"text": "Optimized speed and quick loading times", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "textStyle", "attrs": {"color": "black", "fontSize": "12px", "fontFamily": "Calibri, sans-serif"}}]}]}]}}}, {"id": "section-1787125952822", "type": "text", "order": 5, "title": "Website & CMS Functionalities", "content": {"html": "<ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\"><strong>Site &amp; Content Management</strong></span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">WYSIWYG editor to create, edit and format website content without requiring technical expertise.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Manage content across dynamic pages such as About, Sustainability, CSR, Careers and Contact Us.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Ability to add, edit, publish, unpublish and delete content through the CMS.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Content hierarchy and navigation management for organising website pages and sections.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\"><strong>Product Management</strong></span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Dedicated product management module for managing the MDF product portfolio.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Ability to add, edit, update, publish/unpublish and delete products.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Manage product categories including Standard MDF, BOIL X, FR MDF, HDMR MDF and Prelam MDF.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Manage product descriptions, specifications, images and other relevant product information.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\"><strong>Banner Management</strong></span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Dedicated module to manage homepage and applicable inner-page banners.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Admins can add, edit, replace, activate, deactivate and delete banners.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\"><strong>SEO Management</strong></span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Backend functionality to manage essential on-page SEO parameters for major website pages.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Ability to update page title, meta description and relevant SEO fields.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Customisable URL/slugs for applicable dynamic pages.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">SEO-friendly content structure to support future organic search optimisation.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\"><strong>Forms &amp; Enquiry Management</strong></span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Implementation of enquiry/contact forms as defined in the approved Figma designs.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Form submissions to be routed to designated email IDs.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\"><strong>Social Media Linking</strong></span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Integration of social media links across relevant sections of the website.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Ability to manage/update social media profile links through the CMS.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\"><strong>Google Analytics Integration</strong></span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Integration of Google Analytics to track website traffic, user behaviour and key engagement metrics.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\"><strong>Admin &amp; User Management</strong></span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Secure backend login for authorised CMS users.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Ability to create and manage admin users, subject to the CMS architecture.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Role-based access can be configured for different levels of content management, wherever required.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"font-size: 12px;\\">Secure authentication and access controls for the CMS.</span></p></li></ul></li></ul><p></p>", "json": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": 